fields.help_en:
Tag key. The following keys are supported:  

system.resource.id: instance ID  
system.resource.type: instance type within a product (a product may have multiple instance types)  
    DSW includes Instance, IdleCuller, etc.;  
    DLC includes Job, Tensorboard, etc.;  
    EAS includes Service, ResourceGroup, etc.;  
    TrainingService includes TrainingJob;  
system.product.type: product type, supporting DLC, DSW, EAS, Designer, Paiflow, LangStudio, Image, CodeSource, Dataset, and TrainingService  
system.source.type: source type, supporting ModelGallery
